Unequal basis on an unpriced replacement is invalid even when opening basis is missing.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity NEW
  format 1,000.000000 NEW
commodity OLD
  format 1,000.0000 OLD
account Assets:Shares
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Shares  1 OLD
  Equity:Opening  -1 OLD
2024-02-01 Replacement
  Assets:Shares  2 NEW {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Shares  -1 OLD {{99 SEK}}

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive OLD posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}); the default commodity is SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] An unpriced commodity replacement changes acquisition basis from 99 SEK to 100 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:13:1

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Equity:Opening: holding is -1 OLD on 2024-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3
